* text=auto eol=lf

# Migration SQL is content-addressed: `scripts/db-migrate.mjs` verifies the
# SHA-256 of `drizzle/0005_big_gauntlet.sql` byte-for-byte and
# `tests/integration/canonical-migrations.test.ts` records the same digest in
# `drizzle.__drizzle_migrations`. Git's `core.autocrlf` rewriting LF to CRLF on
# checkout changes those bytes and breaks the compatibility check on Windows.
# Keep migration SQL exactly as committed on every platform.
*.sql -text
